    "headline": "CoStar’s Stock Popped. Can Earnings Keep the Momentum Going?",
    "summary": "CoStar Group  stock on Monday jumped ahead of earnings.  CoStar  stock closed at $29.17 on Monday, up 5.5%, the largest gain since July 16, according to Dow Jones Market Data.  CoStar is “the ‘Bloomberg of commercial real estate (CRE) data,’” BMO Capital Markets analysts Jeffrey Silber and Ryan Griffin wrote in a July 17 note, referring to the Bloomberg financial data terminal widely used by Wall Street.",
